{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-00818-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["증거들은 여객기가 이란의 지대공 미사일을 맞고 추락했다는 것을 가리킨다","다만 \"고의는 아닌 것으로 보인다\"고 덧붙였다"],"reason":"The summary keeps the allegation, Trump's doubt and Trudeau's statement. It leaves out the 'not intentional' qualifier, Iran's denial and the CNN and WSJ reports. It also drops '가리킨다' and says the evidence 'said' the plane was hit, which is a slightly awkward rendering."},"B":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":3,"utility":4,"evidence":["우크라이나국제항공(PS 752편) 소속 보잉 737-800 여객기는 지난 7일 오전 6시 12분","미 정부 당국자는 \"이란이 여객기를 쐈다는 높은 수준의 확신을 갖고 있다\""],"reason":"It covers the US, Canada and UK positions, the flight details and the WSJ-cited US official. It omits Iran's denial and the 'not intentional' qualifier. The phrase '증거를 밝혔고' is awkward and vague about what Trudeau said."},"C":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":4,"evidence":["가장 많은 63명의 사망자가 나온 캐나다의 저스틴 트뤼도 총리","CNN은 소식통을 인용해 ... SA-15 두 발을 맞고 떨어진 것으로 보인다고 보도했다"],"reason":"It accurately conveys Trump's quote, Trudeau's statement with the 63 deaths, and the CNN report on the SA-15 missiles. It omits Iran's denial, the UK position and the 'not intentional' qualifier, which are minor losses."},"D":{"adequacy":1,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["\"고의는 아닌 것으로 보인다\"","\"우리 자체적으로, 또 동맹으로부터 정보를 얻었다\"","가장 많은 63명의 사망자가 나온"],"reason":"It says Trudeau 'deliberately' revealed the evidence, which garbles the source's 'not intentional' remark and distorts the relation. It also ties the 63 deaths to the 7th and to the crash in a muddled way, and omits Trudeau's actual conclusion that the plane was hit by an Iranian missile."}}}
